The String Sovereign is the neutral elite of the Marionettist. Foes it tangles
attack weaker, its Tangle pushes them further back, and at the top rank it
snags three foes at once.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Cut strings        a foe you tangle has -15 Attack on its next attack
  35 Fine fingers       +2 Attack on the doll's blows
  40 Drawn taut         Tangle pushes a foe's action meter back by 70
  45 Sure hands         +2 damage on the doll's blows
  50 Deeper cut         a tangled foe has -25 Attack on its next attack
  55 Master's fingers   +2 Attack on the doll's blows
  60 Sovereign strings  Tangle snags three foes and pushes each back by 75

It needs the Marionettist first (<ansi fg="command">help dollmaster-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30
a character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] string-sovereign confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Doll Master talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Iron Hide (+5 Armor), Heartwood
(+15 health on every doll), Master Carver (+2 damage on every doll's blows).
See <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help dollmaster-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
